{
 "format": 1,
 "about": "The AE heavy revolver pack (folder revolver): ZTeam's heavy revolver as its h3b model (world and first-person; ZTeam left it untextured) dressed with ZTeam's h3 version of the gun: its base and multipurpose maps (re-dressed for the h3b model by revolver_art.py, in a dark red and metal palette, its lights an energy red), its black metal shader, weapon tag, animations, collision, sounds and HUD; an Xbox weapon tuned as a heavy close-to-mid sidearm that fires one slow, heavy slug (ZTeam's fires 16 pellets). The role's numbers re-expressed for AE's 75 + 75 player: a slug is 31 % of a full player (46.4 of 150), so two strip a shield, three kill with the last to the head, four to the body, a slug and a blow kill; the rest as the role has them: 8 a drum, 24 to start, 40 at most, 1.67 slugs a second, a slow, dropping slug, aim assist 3 degrees to 15 units, magnetism 10 degrees to 25. Under SWAT rules (no shields, headshots kill) one slug to the head kills and two to the body. Everything the stock pistol has is the map's. make_pack.py runs it; the locations of the zip, the stock map and the programs are given on its command line (--zip).",
